			"notes": "Area Mine v4.5.5 for Minecraft 1.21.11 (Fabric)\n\n- /areamine messages — turn token chat on/off (action bar still shows)\n- Fixed mining outline particles (solid blocks + larger upgrades)\n- Fixed preview showing wrong blocks when looking ahead\n- Upgrades command cleanup: /areamine upgrades buy …, patterns under upgrades\n- Buy suggestions use spaced names (Auto Pickup, etc.)\n- Fixed /areamine undo taking items from the whole session\n- Cleared debug console spam\n\nInstall: drop the jar into your server's mods/ folder (Fabric API required)."
